The source expectations in answer-policy.examples were transcribed from the single-answer scoring contract in Plans/Architecture/EXAM-DSL-LOGIC-CORRECTION-PLAN.md and the pre-existing exam-scoring/answer-evaluation.core-data oracle. A quarter is 0.25 point. Each example row describes a normalized fact vector, not an invented paper question. The full-variant and canonical-over-variant rows distinguish which credit source wins. No expected value is read from generated output.
